# Build context for apps/cms/Dockerfile is the repo root. Keep it small and keep
# host-built artefacts and secrets out of the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/out
**/.tmp
**/.cache
**/.strapi
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
apps/web/**
!apps/web/package.json
content
design
docs
openspec
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.turbo
